* @title case folding resolves lowercase indirect and apply names
* @attribution Snoflake [PLB28][PLB30]
* @expect >>>
* APRIL
* MAY
* dup ran
* <<<
          month = 'APRIL'
          name = 'month'
          output = $name
          $name = 'MAY'
          output = month
          define('dup()')               :(end_dup)
dup       output = 'dup ran'            :(return)
end_dup
          apply('dup', null)
END
